# RETIRED — this env file configured the generic, unsafe deploy that set
# MEL_DEPLOY_PATH=/home/mel and rsync --delete'd into it. It is no longer read
# by any script.
#
# The current deployment architecture has NO generic target and NO env-supplied
# deployment path. This repository (Mel_hold) deploys ONLY Hold, via one
# hardcoded script:
#
#   deploy/deploy-hold.sh        -> /home/mel/sites/myeventlane_hold
#
# Staging/production MyEventLane are owned by a SEPARATE repository and are NOT
# deployable from here: https://github.com/anna-pye/mel-deployment
#
# There is deliberately nothing to configure here. See:
#   docs/deployment/repository-ownership.md
#   docs/deployment/deployment-flow.md
#   docs/deployment/server-layout.md
